{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "id": "x-touch",
  "name": "Behringer X-Touch",
  "notes": "Behringer X-Touch in Mackie Control (MC) mode. Faders are motorized and addressed by pitchbend on channels 1-9 (9 = main). Encoder LED rings listen on CC 48-55 (encoder CC + 32) on channel 1; ledRing.channel stores that CC number (v1 'returnChannel'), values 32 (off) to 43 (full) sweep the ring. Encoder push buttons are the knobs themselves and have no LED (the ring belongs to the encoder), so their led capability is 'none'. The jog wheel (CC 60) has no controllable LED ring. Scribble strips are addressed by slot index via sysex; each shows 2 lines of 7 characters (segments = 7 per line). The 7-segment timecode area is driven by the mapping's enableTimecodeSend, not by an assignable control.",
  "manufacturer": "Behringer",
  "mode": "mc",
  "defaultMidiChannel": 1,
  "layout": {
    "width": 40,
    "height": 19
  },
